    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The [`rustc_interface`] allows you to intercept diagnostics that would otherwise be printed to stderr.",
      "source_hash": 729068249166536281,
      "context_hash": 2493355951683897054,
      "translation": "[`rustc_interface`]를 사용하면 원래는 stderr로 출력될 진단을 가로챌 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:28:20.222032Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting diagnostics",
      "source_hash": 7350750982344448333,
      "context_hash": 8939057947952146070,
      "translation": "진단 얻기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:28:20.222032Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To get diagnostics from the compiler, configure [`rustc_interface::Config`] to output diagnostic to a buffer, and run [`TyCtxtEnsureOk::typeck`] for each item.",
      "source_hash": 14088554593756787535,
      "context_hash": 8638586035378829566,
      "translation": "컴파일러에서 진단을 얻으려면 진단을 버퍼로 출력하도록 [`rustc_interface::Config`]를 구성하고, 각 항목에 대해 [`TyCtxtEnsureOk::typeck`]를 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:28:20.222032Z",
